1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,300
O Land of Beauty! Our country where peace abounds, 

2
00:00:06,400 --> 00:00:14,100
Thy children stand free, on the strength of will and love. 

3
00:00:14,200 --> 00:00:20,500
With God in all our struggles, St. Kitts and Nevis be, 

4
00:00:20,600 --> 00:00:29,400
A nation bound together, with a common destiny! 

5
00:00:29,500 --> 00:00:36,400
As stalwarts we stand! For justice and liberty, 

6
00:00:36,500 --> 00:00:44,300
With wisdom and truth, we will serve and honour thee.

7
00:00:44,400 --> 00:00:51,300
No sword or spear shall conquer, for God will sure defend,

8
00:00:51,500 --> 00:00:55,400
His blessing shall forever, 

9
00:00:55,550 --> 00:01:01,400
To posterity extend!